{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24434","headline":"与梦得沽酒闲饮且约後期 · 白居易","name":"与梦得沽酒闲饮且约後期","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少时犹不忧生计，老後谁能惜酒钱。\n共把十千沽一斗，相看七十欠三年。\n闲徵雅令穷经史，醉听清吟胜管弦。\n更待菊黄家酝熟，共君一醉一陶然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}